# Between-scene "On the Way Down", ~80 s (docs/design/mission-e2-03.md Cinematic hooks `c_e2_stair`, campaign-outline.md
# 3.2): after e2m3's victory, before e2m4's briefing (StoryFlow: CampaignState.STORY_FILMS c_e2_stair -> e2m4). Night at
# the Emberfall watch-keep; the old stair under the observatory, unsealed; Vey and Vessa at the top step while the
# Greywater guides light lanterns below; Vey's story, half of it (the Master's sword "before the four", behind the throne
# when kings still knelt; the lightning is "his storm, not mine"); "And when were you going to tell me?" / "On the way
# down." (pays off ep1 V5 and c_e2_ashes); Wren brings Ysolde's word: Nature's army follows them down; the last shot:
# the stair descending into a faint white-gold glow.
# Text source for i18n / voices: data/voice/lines/c_e2_stair.json (the same text as the lines below). Lines written
# from the spec's beats on 2026-10-08: every line is in docs/design/film-text-review.md for the game designer.
# Set: forge_watch_keep (keep at (0,-10), gate (0,2); its puppets vessa / guard_w / guard_e). Prop: the stair-house
# art/cinematics/props/ep2_between/stair_mouth.tscn at (5,0,-5), descending toward -Z (into the keep's foundations).
# Stand-ins: Wren = a Wildwood Archer (as in ep2_opening), the guides = Greywater Trackers.
# Axis: Vessa - Vey on the stair's rim (an east-west line at z ~ -2.1); every talk camera stays on its -Z side (over the
# stair, looking up at their faces); the opening wide and the last shot cross it behind a fade.
cine c_e2_stair  title="On the Way Down"  letterbox=2.39  seed=43  length=70..96
use set forge_watch_keep
use music res://assets/audio/music/music_menu.wav  vol=-24
env night  moon_yaw=200  moon_pitch=-30  energy=0.5  color=#9fb4ff
prop  stair  res://art/cinematics/props/ep2_between/stair_mouth.tscn  at=(5, 0, -5)  yaw=0
cast  vey     res://art/units/helpers/helper_vey/helper_vey.tscn                at=(5.9, 0, -2.0)   yaw=200
cast  guide1  res://art/units/neutral/tracker/tracker.tscn                      at=(4.45, 0.0, -6.45)  yaw=150
cast  guide2  res://art/units/neutral/tracker/tracker.tscn                      at=(5.6, 0.0, -6.6)  yaw=200
cast  wren    res://art/units/nature/wildwood_archer/wildwood_archer.tscn       at=(0, 0, 12)  yaw=180  hidden=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the watch-keep at night, the stair open
# Wide crane from the south-east over the wall: the keep dark, one line of lanterns going down into the ground
shot T1 8.0  cam=crane  from=(15, 10, 17)  to=(10, 5.5, 9)  look=(4, 1.0, -4)>(5, 0.6, -4.5)  fov=46>40  in=fade_black:1.2
  at 0.0  teleport vessa  to=(4.4, 0, -2.2)  yaw=180
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_amb.wav  vol=-14
  at 3.0  anim guide1 play_cast
  at 5.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-20
# From the steps, looking up at Vessa on the rim
shot T2 6.5  cam=dolly  from=(4.3, 1.0, -4.7)  to=(4.3, 1.05, -4.4)  look=vessa  fov=36
  at 0.6  line vessa "Ashby says the seal was older than the keep."
# Two-shot, they turn to each other
shot T3 8.0  cam=dolly  from=(5.3, 1.55, -5.9)  to=(5.2, 1.55, -5.5)  look=(5.15, 1.6, -2.1)  fov=40  faces=vessa,vey
  at 0.0  face vessa  to=vey  time=0.6
  at 0.0  face vey  to=vessa  time=0.6
  at 0.6  line vey "Older than the kingdom. He sealed it the day he took the throne."
# CU Vessa: she knows that tone
shot T4 5.0  cam=static  from=(5.25, 1.62, -3.75)  look=vessa  fov=30
  at 0.4  line vessa "You talk about the Master like you knew him before we did."
# CU Vey: the sword before the four
shot T5 10.0  cam=dolly  from=(4.95, 1.72, -3.55)  to=(5.0, 1.72, -3.4)  look=vey  fov=30
  at 0.5  line vey "Before the four of you, there was a sword. I was the sword."
  at 5.0  line vey "I stood behind his throne when kings still knelt to it."
# Two-shot: the lightning
shot T6 9.5  cam=dolly  from=(4.6, 1.45, -5.0)  to=(4.75, 1.45, -4.7)  look=(5.15, 1.6, -2.1)  fov=38  faces=vessa,vey
  at 0.4  line vessa "And the lightning? No kingdom throws lightning."
  at 3.9  line vey "It's his storm, not mine. He lent it to me to keep you four alive."
  at 4.2  fade color=#fff6dc  alpha=0.28  time=0.12
  at 4.5  fade alpha=0  time=0.5
  at 4.2  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-18
shot T7 4.5  cam=static  from=(5.3, 1.6, -3.7)  look=vessa  fov=30
  at 0.4  line vessa "And when were you going to tell me?"
shot T8 4.5  cam=static  from=(4.95, 1.72, -3.5)  look=vey  fov=28
  at 1.0  line vey "On the way down."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ysolde's word
# From the stair toward the gate: Wren runs in from the road
shot T9 7.0  cam=static  from=(4.8, 2.2, -6.2)  look=(2.6, 1.3, 0.2)  fov=42  faces=wren
  at 0.0  teleport wren  to=(0.4, 0, 8)  yaw=180
  at 0.0  show wren
  at 0.2  move wren  to=(2.6, 0, -0.6)  speed=3.2
  at 1.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/snow_step.wav  vol=-14
  at 2.2  face vessa  to=wren  time=0.5
  at 2.2  face vey  to=wren  time=0.5
  at 2.6  line wren "Vessa! Word from Ysolde."
shot T10 7.0  cam=dolly  from=(3.4, 1.5, -3.4)  to=(3.3, 1.5, -3.2)  look=wren  fov=34
  at 0.5  line wren "Nature's army follows you down. All of it that can still walk."
shot T11 5.0  cam=static  from=(4.0, 1.55, -4.6)  look=vessa  fov=32
  at 0.0  face vessa  to=(4.4, 0, -6)  time=0.8
  at 0.6  line vessa "Then we don't keep them waiting."

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- down
# High behind them over the rim: they start down the steps into the glow (crosses the axis after a dip to black)
shot T12 10.0  cam=crane  from=(5.2, 3.4, 1.4)  to=(5.1, 2.4, -0.4)  look=(5, 0.6, -4.2)>(5, 0.3, -5.2)  fov=44  in=fade_black:0.8
  at 0.4  move vessa  to=(4.6, 0.55, -3.9)  speed=0.9
  at 0.9  move vey  to=(5.5, 0.55, -3.9)  speed=0.9
  at 1.2  line vey "Mind the seventh step. It bites."
  at 9.0  fade alpha=1 time=1.0
